      "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;\">KC桌面——外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;\">美元/人民币中间价模型：预测值：6.7773</p></section>\n<h2 style=\"margin:24px 0 12px;color:#152033;font-size:22px;line-height:1.35;\">美元/人民币中间价模型</h2>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4;\">预测值：6.7773</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px;\">模型预测值：6.7773，前值为6.8184（下行411个基点；较前一日官方收盘价上行53个基点）。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVgCUwVib9Uz2XBdibgrRXfYVunXAs8pIIzBGk2un49cz4pd3s4SWzhJEfCVICkwH3m8HkbqWSQcHhHt4TMiaTicVkNWf54gJofRDE/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"[[KC_IMAGE_001]]\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUlVEO5BLtwG4WujMCCiaDtv9uhMcHibOWwe06MvLmjibVH4PrGq9gIJWUosYjA5ZaBlquJbo1CAmb8Rrp6mJoemWD5RTtCFlmuUY/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"[[KC_IMAGE_002]]\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVgad6QzsicIRvKOIRdvhdleKOyB4uvVdicaQuyEZu1HOnSRkbRk52JmfxoHlib8fKicvmrraUiavghk64fBPywjxqr5kaSgKcqwZKw/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"[[KC_IMAGE_003]]\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\" /></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4;\">附录A-1</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px;\">本报告由NOM新加坡有限公司（NSL）编制。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:24px 0 12px;padding:14px 16px;background:#F7F3E8;border-left:4px solid #C9A227;color:#152033;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600;\">更多完整报告和后续精译，扫文末图片进群交流。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;\">For informational purposes only. Not investment advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWnZxpbkuvrCDV7Lc5C3982UvE1iavJ40xJmHkF9XP97myBVibhH3oPRh73kx5XM99IkfL5eOicm6nbsVVTNBCcFyTtBBRl6oK8hk/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC Desk\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\" /></p>",
